# trainer/data/ holds small checked-in artifacts (e.g. level_alignment.json),
# not the ML "data/" this section means to ignore — un-ignore it explicitly so
# new files there aren't silently dropped (previously needed `git add -f`).
!trainer/data/
!trainer/data/**

